<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 TIM 56 Soli bible version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya cibili ya Paulo kuli Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya cibili ya Paulo kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoti</para>
  <para style="imt">BUSANSULUSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku lya Timoti wa cibili ni kalata yacibili ya mutumwa Paulo njalatuma kuli shikwiya Timoti. Libuku ili lya Timoti lyalalembwa cakumapwililisho a buyumi bwa Paulo. Pacindici walikuba wasungwa mu jele ku Loma. 1:16. Palikuba kunyumfwana kwaina pakati pali Paulo ne Timoti, kayi cindi conse walikumukuweti mwaname Bafilipi 2:22, 2 Timoti 1:12; 1:18,</para>
  <para style="ip">Kayi ni kalata ya makalata ana kufuma kuli Paulo alatumwa kubantu mumusena wakutuma ku mubungano. Makalata ambi atatu ni 1 Timoti, Tito ne Filimoni. Pacindi Paulo ncalikulemba Timoti wa cibili, baklistu bangi balikuba mu mapensho mu bwendeleshi bwa Ciloma, mpani ecebo cakendi Paulo ncalikubela mujele, ne kupa malailile Timoti kwambeti alimbikile mumakatasho. Mbuli mu Timoti wakutanguna, Paulo lamucenjeshenga Timoti sha beshikwiyisha bandemi shibili 1 Tim 1:16-18. Kayi lamwambilinga Timoti kwambeti kuntangu kulakesana cindi camakatasho. 2 Tim 3:1</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakutanguna Paulo lamupanga mitende Timoti 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi lamuyuminishinga Timoti kuba walimbikila 2:1-13</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo lamupanga malailile angi 2:14-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Lamucenjeshenga sha bintu byeshibikenshike kuntangu, kayi ne nshila yakwinshilamo 3:1 mpaka 4:8</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo lapwishinga ne kwambapo kwakendi pali Timoti.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame, Paulo mutumwa wa Klistu Yesu kwelana ne kuyanda kwa Lesa, walatumwa kuya kukambauka sha buyumi mbwalatushomesha mukwikatana ne Klistu Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ndalembelenga obe Timoti mwaname ngonsuni.</para>
  <para style="p">ndasengengeti luse, nkumbo kayi ne lumuno lwa Lesa Bata ne Klistu Yesu Mwami wetu, bibe pali njobe.</para>
  <para style="s">Lalumbaishinga Lesa ne kumuyuminisha Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ndalumbunga Lesa ngondasebenselenga ne miyeyo yaswepa yabula mbuli bamashali bakame bakulukulu ncebalikwinsa. Ndalumbunga pakwinga nkandakulubunga mu mipailo yakame munshi ne mashiku sobwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndanuka ncewalikulila misoshi, nkute kuyanda kwisa kukubona kwambeti nkakondwe ca makasa abili. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ndanuka lushomo lwa ncinencine ndobakute banyoko ba Yunisi ne bankambuyobe batukashi ba Loisi, ndashometi nenjobe elushomo ndokute.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco ndakwanushungeti usheko mano kucipo ca Lesa ncokute ico ncewalatambula pasa mpondalabika makasa akame pali njobe ucisosele mulilo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa liya kutupa Mushimu wa buyowa sobwe, Mushimu wa Lesa ukute kutupa ngofu, nelusuno kwambeti tucikonshenga kulitibuka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco kotanyumfwanga nsoni kuba kamboni wa Mwami Yesu, nambi kunyumfwa nsoni cebo ca kwambeti ame ndasungwa muno mu jele, obe libambile kucana mapensho, nomba Lesa nakakupe ngofu shakukambauka Mulumbe Waina. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Walatupulusha ne kutukuwa kwambeti tube bantu bakendi, nkatwalikuba twelela kucitambula, nsombi bwalikuba bubambo ne nkumbo sha Lesa. nkumbo nshalatulesha kupitila mukwikatana ne Klistu Yesu kacitana cilengwa cindi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino Lesa walatuyubulwila ibi bintu mpwalaboneka Mupulushi wetu Klistu Yesu, nendi ewalapwisha ngofu sha lufu kupitila mu Mulumbe Waina, latwishibishi cena motwela kucanina buyumi butafu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lesa walansala kwambeti mbe mukambaushi, mutumwa kayi shikwiyisha Mulumbe Waina. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Encondapengelenga, ndiya nsoni pakwinga ndimwishi ngondashoma. Neco ndashometi wela kutabilisha cena bintu mbyabika mumakasa akame mpaka busuba bwashakabwele. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino ikatisha camakasa abili maswi acancine ncine ngondalakwiyisha kwambeti, lushomo ne lusuno lwetu mukwikatana ne Klistu Yesu bibe cilesho kwakobe ca kukonkela. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kupitila muMushimu Uswepa ngotukute, ukunyamfwe kubamba cena buboni bwa palubasu mbowalapewa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ucishi kwambeti bonse mu cimpansha ca Asiya balanshiya ndenka, pali abo balanshiya pali Figelo ne Hemojene. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nkumbo sha Lesa shibe mung'anda ya Onesifolo, pakwinga ewalikwisa kunjuminisha tunkanda twingi, kayi nkali kunyumfwa nsoni pakumbona kandi ndasungwa nshimbi mu jele. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mpwalesa ku Loma walanangaula mpaka walancana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nkumbo sha Lesa shikabe pali Onesifolo pa busuba bwa lombolosho. Obe ucishi kufula kwa ncito shaina nshalikunyamfwa mpondalikuba ku Efenso.</para>
  <para style="s">Mushilikali wa Klistu</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mushilikali wa Klistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Obe mwaname mulushomo, koyuminina mu nkumbo nshetukute mukwikatana ne Klistu Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Konkela njiyishilo njowalanyumfwa ame kang'amba pa bakamboni bangi, nenjobe wiyisheko bantu beti bakacikonshe kwiyishako nabambi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mantamo lubasu mu mapensho pakubeti mushilikali washomwa wa Klistu Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mushilikali nkakute kusha mano ku ncito shimbi, nsombi ukute kuyanda kukondwelesha mushilikali mukulene lamulangililinga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nendi weshikufwamba lubilo lwa kufola mali nkabela kumufolesha na walilwa kukonkela milawo ya mfwambilo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>kayi mulimi lasebensenga mwangofu ewela nanshi kulya bishango byakutanguna kutebula. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Usheko mano ku makani ngondakwambili, Mwami Yesu nakakunyamfwe kwishiba bintu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwanukangeti, Yesu Klistu uyo walasemwa mu mukowa wa Dafeti, walapunduka kubafu mbuli ncolambanga Mulumbe Waina ngonkute kukambauka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ndasungwa ncetani eti kapondo muno mu jele cebo ca kukambauka Mulumbe Waina, nomba necikabeco maswi a Lesa nkasungwa ncetani sobwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco, nteti ntentuke cebo ca bantu mbwalasala Lesa kwambeti naboyo bakatambule lupulusho lwalesa kupitila muli Klistu Yesu kayi ne kutambula bulemu butapu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Makani awa nacancine ncine alambangeti;</para>
  <para style="q">Na twalafwila pamo nendi</para>
  <para style="q">nitukekale nebuyumi pamo nendiye.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na tulimbikila</para>
  <para style="q">nitukendeleshe pamo.</para>
  <para style="q">Na tukamukane,</para>
  <para style="q">nendi nakatukane.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na nkatwashomeka,</para>
  <para style="q">nendi nakabenga washomeka,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga nkela kulikana.</para>
  <para style="s">Musebenshi washomeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kobanushanga bantu bintu ibi, ne kubacenjesha mwangofu pamenso a Lesa kwambeti kabatatotekeshananga pa maswi, nkacikute kunyamfwa sobwe. pakwinga cikute kunyonganya bantu balakutikinga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Elekesha mwangofu kuba wasuminishiwa pamenso a Lesa, eti musebenshi wabula nsoni; Ukute kwiyisha cena ancinencine. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Talamuka ku mibandi yabuluya italete bulemu kuli Lesa, pakwinga ikute kubatalamusha kuli Lesa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakwinga mibandi ilico ilyeti cilonda cinene citashilikiki. Humenayo ne Fileto ebantu basuna mibandi ilico, <verse number="18" style="v"/>balashiyi mukondo wancine ncine, balanyonganyango'wa lushomo lwa bantu, balambangeti bantu bafwa balapunduka kendi, kwamba kulico nteko kwa ncinencine sobwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nikukabeco, mpwaibaka Lesa nkapela kutenkanishiwa sobwe, pakwinga palembweti, “Mwami, ubeshi bantu bakendi” Kayi pali maswi akwambeti, “Muntu lakambilinga Mwami aleke kwinsa bintu byabula kululama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mung'anda inene mukute kuba mbale shapusana pusana, shagolide neshasilifa neshakubesa kayi ne shakubumba. Pa mbale ishi pali shakusebensesha cindi conse, nashimbi nishakubensesha pa cindi celela. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na muntu ucileka kwinsa byaipa, uliswepesha, ulyeti mbale shakusebensesha pa cindi celela, pakwinga nakabe waswepa kuli Mwami wakendi, kwambeti amusebenseshe cindi conse muncito yaina. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Talamuka ku lunkumbwa lwa mubili. Obe konkela bululami, nelushomo, nelusuno kayi ne lumuno. Ikatana pamo ne bantu balakambililinga Mwami ne myoyo yaswepa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kayi koleka kumantamo lubasu mu kutotekeshanya kwa buluya kwabula mano, ucisheti kukutowa kuleta kukangana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Musebenshi wa Mwami Lesa nkela kuba shikukangano'wa ne bantu, nsombi wela kunyumfwila nkumbo bantu bonse, shikwiyisha wekalikana cena moyo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kolicepeshanga wambanga ne bantu balakutotekenga, mpani Lesa ngobapa cindi ca kusanduka kwambeti beshibe ca ncinencine mwalumbuluka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mpani mano abo ngabwelelamo kwambeti bafume mu kose ka Satana wabekateti bensenga ncalayandanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Masuba amapwililisho</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Masuba a mapwililisho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ishibeti masuba akupwililisha nakabe amakatasho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakwinga nikukabe bantu balisuna, balunkumbwa lwa bubile, beshikulilumbaisha, beshikulisumpula, babula bulemu,bamatuka, batanyumfwili bamashali, batalumbu kayi batasakamana cendo cabo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Babula lusuno, batalekelele banabo, beshikubumba makani, batakonsho kulitibuka, bakalu, batasuni bintu byaina. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Beshikulisha banabo, batasakamana ne buyumi, beshi kulitunta, kayi mu musena wa kusuna Lesa, balo nibakasunengo'wa bintu bishi kubakondwelesha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Beshi kuboneka kunsa eti balapailinga Lesa, kakuli balakananga ngofu yela kubashinta micito yabo yaipa, bantu balico ubatalamuke. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pakati pabo pali bantu bakute kwenda kashila mbali kuya mu manda abantu kuya kwikata busha batukashi baluya, balefuka balemenwa ne bwipishi kayi, bamantika ne lunkumbwa lwapusana pusana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Aba batukashi bakute kuyandishisha kwiya cindi conse, nsombi nkabakute kucana ca ncinencine sobwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mbuli Yanesi ne Yambule ncebalamutoteka Mose, aba naboyo balalwananga ne cancine ncine. Miyeyo yabo yafwa, lushomo lwabo ntelo lwa ncinencine. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nambi balenshingeco, paliya nkobalenga pakwinga buluya bwabo nibukaboneke kubantu bonse mbuli ncebwalaboneka buluya bwa Yambule ne Yanesi.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akulayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino obe wishicena ncenkute kwiyisha, wishi cena cendo cakame, ne miyeyo yakame, ne lushomo lwakame, ne kwikalikana moyo kwakame, ne lusuno lwakame, kayi ne kutatyompwa kwakame. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kayi waishi makatasho ne mapensho ngondalakumana nawo ku Antiyokeya, neku Ikoniya ne ku Lusitala. Ee, ndalapenga, nsombi Mwami walampulusha mu mapensho onsa'wo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kayi ni cancinencine uliyense layandanga buyumi muli Yesu Klistu nibakamupenshe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba bamicito yaipa ne bandemishibili nibakapitilishepo kwipa kubepa ne kubepwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba obe konkela mbyowaleishiwa ne kubishoma pakwinga ubeshi bantu balakwiyisha bintu ibi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kufuma kubutwanike bwakobe uleshibi Mabala Aswepa ela kukupa mano akushoma muli Klistu Yesu kwambeti ukapuluke. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mabala Aswepa onse alafubailwa ne Lesa kayi alayandikinga pa kwiyisha, pakukansa bantu pa bilubo byabo, pa kululamika bintu ne kupa busele mubululami. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwambeti muntu lasebenselenda Lesa abe wakwana cancinencine kwinsa ncito iliyonse yaina.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pamenso a Lesa ne Klistu Yesu, uyo lakesanga kombolosha bayumi ne bafwa, pakwinga lakesanga kali Mwami, ndakwambilinga mwangofu ndeti, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kambauka Mulumbe wa Lesa pa cindi bantu ncebalayandanga kukutika, ne pa cindi ncebatasuni kukutika. Balulamike nekubakalalila kayi ne kubayuminisha pakubeisha ca moyonteka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Cilakashikinga cindi nceti bakatatike kukana kwiyisha kwa ncine ncine, neco nibakayande beshikwiyisha bintu byelana ne mbyobalandanga kunyumfwa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nibakakonkelengo'wa tulabi ne kukana kunyumfwa ca ncine ncine, <verse number="5" style="v"/>obe kolilama mu bintu byonse, kotalefuka mumakatasho, sebensa ncito ya kukambauka Mulumbe Waina, kwanilisha ncito yakobe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ame ndili pepi kufwa. Buyumi bwakame bulyeti mulumbo uletilwanga pa nteme. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ndalwana nkondo yaina, ndapwishi kufwamba lubilo kayi ndashomeke mpaka kumapwililisho. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pa cino cindi munshini wa bululami ulampembelelenga uwo Mwami Lesa momboloshi walulama ngoshakampe pa busuba busa, nomba nteti akapo'wa ame ndenka, nsombi nakape bonse balapembelelenga kwisa kwakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi a Paulo mwine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Fwambana kwisa kuno, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Dema layandishishi bintu bya mucishi lanshiyi waya ku Tesalonika. Kelesike waya ku Galatiya, neye Tito waya ku Dalamatiya, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuno ndili ne Luka enka. Pakwisa ukese pamo ne Maliko kwambeti akese akanyamfweko ncito. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tukiko ndamutuma ku Efenso. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pakwisa ukandeteleleko munganjo ngondalashiya kuli Kalipo ku Tulowa, kayi ukaletelele asa mabuku akame abipaya. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Alekisandulo shatwela usa walanjinshila bintu byaipa, nsombi Mwami Lesa nakamubweshele byaipa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Alekisandulo walikutoteka mulumbe ngotwali kukambauka, ne njobe ucenjele nendi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mpondali kulitabilisha pakomboloshewa pa cindi cakutanguna paliya walanyamfwa, bonse balamwaika. Nomba Lesa katabapa mulandu sobwe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba Lesa walikuba ne njame, walampa ngofu sha kukambauka mulumbe kwambeti bantu batamwishi Lesa, kayi ndalapuluka kulufu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lesa nakamfune mu byaipa byonse ne kuntwala mu Bwami bwakendi bwa kwilu. Kulyendiye kube bulemu butapu! Ameni.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akulayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Umpeleko mitende Pulisika ne Akula ne ba mung'anda ya Onesifolo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Elasito washalila ku Kolinto, neye Tolofimo ndalamushiya kakolwa pa nsumbu ya Mileto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ufwambane kwisa kuno kacitana cishika cindi ca mupewo.</para>
  <para style="p">Yubulu, ne Puludensi, ne Linosi ne Kolodiyasi kayi ne banse bonse bashoma muli Mwami Klistu balamupanga mitende.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwami abe nenjobe kayi kwina moyo kwakendi Lesa kube nenjamwe.</para>
</usx>
